WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Lie on your back, knees bent, feet hip-width apart near the hips.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Press the feet down and lift the hips toward the sky.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Interlace the hands beneath you and roll the shoulders under.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Keep the knees parallel and breathe into the chest.
